# Keep the build context small and reproducible — install deps from lockfiles, not
# whatever happens to be in the working tree.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
frontend/coverage
data
stacks
.git
.github
.forgejo
docs
*.md
!backend/README.md
scripts
